   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASEAN Scholars Leadership Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ASEAN Scholars Leadership Program is an on-award enrichment program that aims to maximise impact of the Aus4ASEAN Scholarships, with awardees from across ASEAN and Timor-Leste. It supports the enrichment of scholar&#x2019;s experiences in Australia through learning, networking and development opportunities, and builds people-to-people links between Australia and the region.</narrative>
